OL,3,GNEWSATwo more arrests after Halloween
OL,4,Aparty stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo more arrests have been made by
OL,7,Fpolice investigating the stabbing of
OL,8,Ffive teenagers at a Halloween party in
OL,9,FHampshire.
OL,11,FPolice were called shortly after 22:30
OL,12,FGMT on Saturday to a home in Park Road
OL,13,Fin Chandler's Ford where an "unknown
OL,14,Fgroup" had gained entry to the event
OL,15,Fover a garden fence.
OL,17,FOne boy, 17, remains in hospital in a
OL,18,Fserious condition. The other four boys,
OL,19,Fwho were all injured, have since been
OL,20,Fdischarged.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
